# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Quarry
---
The Quarry is a place where rocks are plentiful and sympathy is not, which is the opposite of how I would arrange things, if anyone asked me, and nobody does.

An ancient tortoise looked up from his rock. 'Bump one,' he said, 'and your score will crumble like a stale biscuit. I speak from experience. A great deal of experience.'

Between two boulders the shimmer appeared again, nearer than before, and if a light can look smug, this one did.
